"""
test_cpsat.py
Generates an optimal monthly employee shift roster using Google's CP-SAT solver,
incorporating complex real-world shift lengths and coverage requirements.
The output is formatted into an Excel file matching the requested visual layout,
including coloring for off days and header rows.

Requirements:
  pip install ortools pandas python-dateutil openpyxl
  
Usage example (for a roster with the specific 20 employees for Dec 2025):
  python test_cpsat.py --year 2025 --month 12 --out specific_employee_roster.xlsx --public_holidays 2025-12-25
"""
